* Core biopsy histologically proven Ⅱa-Ⅲc phase breast cancer (regardless of the type);
* Immunohistochemisty（IHC）：ER-，PR-，CerB2-；Triple negative （ER-PR-Her-2-） Hormone receptor negativity is defined as ER\ 9 g/dl);
