12. Has a history of corneal dystrophy that in the opinion of the investigator is significantly affecting the ocular surface (e.g., significant anterior basement membrane dystrophy, Fuch's dystrophy with significant corneal edema and bullae, neurotrophic keratoconjunctivitis or corneal/conjunctival scarring including herpes simplex virus \[HSV\] or varicella zoster virus \[VZV\] keratitis);
13. Has any physical or mental condition interfering with the successful participation in this study;
14. Has had any past head and neck radiation treatment;
