17. Have had punctal occlusion (other than permanent punctal plugs) within 6 months of Visit 1;
18. Have corrected visual acuity greater than or equal to logMAR+0.7 as assessed by Early Treatment of Diabetic Retinopathy Study (ETDRS) scale in either eye at Visit 1
19. Have an uncontrolled systemic disease;
20. Be a woman who is pregnant, nursing or planning a pregnancy;
